  "prefLabel": "Ph 705.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 705.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish procedures for the authorized destruction of controlled substances, with a focus on controlled substances that are not subject to DEA jurisdiction.\n\nSource. #14648, eff 10-13-26, EXPIRES: 10-13-36",
